+### decamelizeKeys(object, options?)
+
+Returns a new object with each own key of a plain object decamelized. Shallow: nested objects and values are left untouched. The `options` are passed to `decamelize`. Throws a `TypeError` for non-plain objects.
+
+```js
+import {decamelizeKeys} from 'decamelize';
+
+decamelizeKeys({unicornRainbow: 1, fooBar: {bazQux: 2}});
+//=> {unicorn_rainbow: 1, foo_bar: {bazQux: 2}}
+```
+
